    "en": {
      "name": "Invoked Dee Anima",
      "effect": "1 \"Aleister\" monster + 1 monster Special Summoned from the Extra Deck\nIf this card is Special Summoned: You can activate 1 of these effects;\n\u25cf Destroy all monsters your opponent controls that were Special Summoned from the Extra Deck.\n\u25cf Destroy all Spells/Traps your opponent controls.\nWhen your opponent activates a card effect in the GY (Quick Effect): You can banish this card; Special Summon 1 \"Aleister\" monster from your Deck, and if you do, negate that effect. You can only use each effect of \"Invoked Dee Anima\" once per turn.",
      "official": false
    },
